            "text": "$\\overrightarrow{BC} = 2(\\overrightarrow{KA} + \\overrightarrow{LA})$"
          },
          {
            "label": "C",
            "text": "$\\overrightarrow{BC} = 2(\\overrightarrow{LA} - \\overrightarrow{KA})$"
          },
          {
            "label": "D",
            "text": "$\\overrightarrow{BC} = \\overrightarrow{KA} - \\overrightarrow{LA}$"
          }
